  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First stable release. License-key activation with hardware-ID binding and multi-device support, encrypted sessions over the AES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 envelope, a server-driven kill switch (ban/pause/expire/HWID-reset/maintenance) with a consecutive-failure guard so an unreachable server ends the session instead of leaving the app running, free trials, remote texts/slides, and OTA update checks.",
